mcstage is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or
sponsored by PaperMC, PurpurMC, Mojang or Microsoft.

No Minecraft, Mojang, Paper, CraftBukkit, Bukkit, Folia or Purpur code is included
in, derived into, or distributed with this project, and no game data is bundled. No
server jar is redistributed: each one is downloaded from its own publisher at the
time it is needed and verified against the digest that publisher published.

The fake server used by the tests is original, written for this project, and
deliberately misbehaves in ways a real server will not do on request.
